notice announces it and then goes [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]away on its own.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]9[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]6[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]snoozed_tasks.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/snoozed_tasks.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-q5[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-q5/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob snooze core, wake writer, and tick step[/bold #D7AFFF]                   [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]wake-engine[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]wake-engine: the snooze module (row grammar, states, time grammar), the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bob snooze list/add/drop/wake CLI with guarded writes, never-running [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]wake placement, struck history rows, the first-position tick step, the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]wake receipt plus Darwin post plus desktop fallback, the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]trailing-section writer audit, shared vectors, and docs/snooze.md.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Snoozed rows in reconcile, walks, plan, and the agenda JSON[/bold #D7AFFF]   [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]planned-today[dim] · [dim][/dim]after wake-engine[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]planned-today: reconcile treats live rows as recovery-only reach and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]never touches them; freshness, ]s, and bob walks exclude snoozed tasks; [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bob plan gains the snoozed meter and forecast lint; capture-pomodoros [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]--tasks gains additive snoozed rows and woke_at.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Capture z:<when> snooze token[/bold #D7AFFF]                                 [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]capture-z[dim] · [dim][/dim]after wake-engine[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]capture-z: the z:<when> token for new and existing-task captures, the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]existing-task grammar exception, link-now and drop interplay with live [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]rows, teaching refusals, completions led by today's event end times, a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]snooze span kind, and docs/capture.md.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Plugin snoozed index, exclusions, cleanup parity, and Obsidian[bold white on #D75F87][/bold #D7AFFF] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]waker[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]plugin-plumbing[dim] · [dim][/dim]after planned-today[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]plugin-plumbing: the ledger-tools JS mirror of the row grammar and live [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]predicate on the shared vectors, isSnoozedToday/isPlannedToday api, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]]s/]w/dash exclusions and the dash.md query edit, cleanup parity in [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]every link-removing gesture, Snoozed-row [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Ctrl+Enter/Alt+N/Ctrl+Shift+Enter semantics, and the minute-tick bob [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]snooze wake spawn with its Notice fallback.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Clock marks, woken-link pills, Snoozed-row paint, and plan [/bold #D7AFFF]   [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]chip[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]plugin-marks[dim] · [dim][/dim]after plugin-plumbing[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]plugin-marks: the alarm-clock definition mark that replaces 🍅 while [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]asleep (amber when due), the woke-time pill on woken Task Links, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Snoozed-row and heading paint, the bob-plan snoozed chip, and the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs/snooze-marks.md display contract with vectors.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Alt+Z Snooze Card and Task Card z[/bold #D7AFFF]                             [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]snooze-card[dim] · [dim][/dim]after plugin-marks[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]snooze-card: the Alt+Z command and Task Card z opening a Snooze Card [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]with ranked time suggestions, a consequence footer, retime/Wake [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]now/Unsnooze on snoozed tasks, teaching refusals for Event and Blocked [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tasks, and a pure JS planner pinned to the shared vectors.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  7 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Mac Later-today band, woken accents, and exact-minute waker[/bold #D7AFFF]   [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]mac-agenda[dim] · [dim][/dim]after planned-today, capture-z[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac-agenda: decode the additive snoozed/woke_at agenda fields, add a dim[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Later-today band that folds first, woken-row accents, a snoozed count on[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the budget row, z: span styling, and an always-on scheduler that runs [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bob snooze wake at next_wake_at.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  8 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Presence-aware wake notice on the Mac[/bold #D7AFFF]                         [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]mac-wake-notice[dim] · [dim][/dim]after mac-agenda[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac-wake-notice: the notifier claim file, snooze-woken receipt observer,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]pure presence and meeting hold policy, the wake notice surface with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]chime and +15m, the menu-bar beacon, the silent Notification Center [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]record with withdrawal, Settings, and Mac docs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  9 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Glossary, guide, decision record, and end-to-end verification[/bold #D7AFFF] [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]close-out[dim] · [dim][/dim]after capture-z, snooze-card, mac-wake-notice[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]close-out: the Snoozed Task glossary strand and regenerated glossary [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]page, the decision record if approved, a how-to guide and concepts [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]paragraph, and a live end-to-end run of every acceptance case across [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bob, Obsidian, and the Mac.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-q5","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-astra","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-q5.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","role_suffix":"plan","vcs_provider":"GitHub","workflow_name":"bob-cli-q5.1"},"source_run_id":"run-be28eb0396d596aadf029ca85b631d24","started_at":"2026-11-25T15:26:19.042255+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"d4b562f1053b65d03277953edd008ec1fc0e4911afbe8440fef5e51a17345d55","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-q5.9/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"bf9e2f3dd6cf0dfcbe281e010bc4c708fc2bec2e4ca1833e4101e8df2fe3d95d","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-q5.9/meta.json","size_bytes":718},"prompt":{"digest":"df033fcd71095109c94505866318e4b2d00a682c9caa50f6058980f510214ab6","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-q5.9/prompt.md","size_bytes":246},"state":{"digest":"87f3114eac04853d221d2913163436c11661136bd40c43fb07f8320cd8dec880","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-q5.9/state.json","size_bytes":163}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-q5.9","local_name":"bob-cli-q5.9","metadata":{"agent_clan":"bob-cli-q5","agent_clan_generation":"20261125102436","bead_id":"bob-cli-q5.9","chang